WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.868
Rachel: When is your birthday, Ricky?

2
00:00:13.869 --> 00:00:19.875
Ricky: It's this Saturday, May 20th.

3
00:00:19.876 --> 00:00:24.129
Father: What do you want to do for your birthday,

4
00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:26.593
Ricky? Do you want to have a party?

5
00:00:26.594 --> 00:00:31.210
Ricky: Yes, I do. I want to invite all my

6
00:00:31.211 --> 00:00:37.548
friends. And I want Super Power Squirrel to come!

7
00:00:37.549 --> 00:00:41.485
Father: That might be difficult, Ricky.

8
00:00:41.486 --> 00:00:46.807
I'll check if he's available.

9
00:00:46.808 --> 00:00:50.782
Ricky: Thanks, Dad! I know you can do it.

10
00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:55.698
Father: Well, Ricky, what presents do you want for your birthday?

11
00:00:55.699 --> 00:01:11.605
Ricky: Hmmm, let me think . .

12
00:01:11.606 --> 00:01:19.819
. Father: Ricky. Ricky!

13
00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:22.625
Rickeeeeey!! Did you hear my question?

14
00:01:22.626 --> 00:01:25.864
Ricky: Sorry, Dad. Yes, I heard you.

15
00:01:25.865 --> 00:01:30.692
I want kangaroo shoes.

16
00:01:30.693 --> 00:01:34.381
Rachel: Ricky, what present can I get you?

17
00:01:34.382 --> 00:01:39.337
Ricky: Don't worry, Rachel. I know you don't have any money.

18
00:01:39.338 --> 00:01:42.716
Rachel: I know! I saw it on

19
00:01:42.717 --> 00:01:45.831
TV. I can bake you a cake.

20
00:01:45.832 --> 00:01:52.455
Ricky: Oh no!

